te change, cites file:line (or a source URL for prior art), and states value, effort (S/M/L) and risk. This lineage's frontier share is F-1-002 (cross-CLI execution contract), F-1-004 (frontier economics), F-1-006 (bookkeeping false alarms), so it reports on those three questions and does not re-report a delivered backlog row.\\\\n\\\\nQ2 Cross-CLI execution contract: across native, cli-claude-code, cli-opencode, cli-codex, cli-pi, cli-devin, cli-cursor, cli-deepseek-harness and cli-mistral-vibe, where do permission and sandbox, effort, output format (cli-claude-code still uses --output-format text, so it reports no tokens or cost), session resume, failure classes, log shape and prompt channel still differ in fanout-run.cjs LINEAGE_COMMAND_ADAPTERS, runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts and dispatch-iteration.cjs (runClaude, runCodex)? What single adapter contract and conformance test would remove the differences, including the agent and command mirrors (.claude .codex .pi .dsh .vibe .opencode against .skilled)?\\\\n\\\\nQ4 Frontier economics: the node cap and growth slots (5 of 7 proposals pruned at iteration 1 last run), the depth-band split, duplicate work, and whether and in which order to build the held backlog rows 12 (one projectFrontier), 13 (one executor path), 29 (alias and dead-probe deletion) and 30 (per-node research dashboard).\\\\n\\\\nQ6 Bookkeeping that fires on a healthy run: the synthesis_incomplete alarm when a finding is refined into an earlier id (runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs:373), the research commit step that fails on an ignored pathspec exclude (deep-research.yaml:2158), the closeout lineageId taken from the parent session, and any other invariant or warning this run shows firing without a real fault.\\\\n\\\\nReport only: change no code or doc outside your own lineage directory.\\\",\\n  \\\"maxIterations\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"convergenceThreshold\\\": 0.05,\\n  \\\"minIterations\\\": 3,\\n  \\\"antiConvergence\\\": {\\n    \\\"minIterations\\\": 3,\\n    \\\"convergenceMode\\\": \\\"default\\\",\\n    \\\"depthMode\\\": \\\"expansive\\\",\\n    \\\"stopPolicy\\\": \\\"convergence\\\",\\n    \\\"divergent\\\": {}\\n  },\\n  \\\"expansiveDepth\\\": {\\n    \\\"maxDepth\\\": 3,\\n    \\\"maxChildrenPerNode\\\": 6,\\n    \\\"budgetSplit\\\": { \\\"depth1\\\": 0.5, \\\"depth2\\\": 0.35, \\\"depth3\\\": 0.15 },\\n    \\\"maxFrontierNodes\\\": null\\n  },\\n  \\\"stuckThreshold\\\": 3,\\n  \\\"maxDurationMinutes\\\": 120,\\n  \\\"maxToolCallsPerIteration\\\": 24,\\n  \\\"maxMinutesPerIteration\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"progressiveSynthesis\\\": true,\\n  \\\"specFolder\\\": \\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode\\\",\\n  \\\"createdAt\\\": \\\"2026-11-20T13:57:00.000Z\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"initialized\\\",\\n  \\\"executionMode\\\": \\\"auto\\\",\\n  \\\"executor\\\": {\\n    \\\"kind\\\": \\\"cli-opencode\\\",\\n    \\\"model\\\": \\\"llmgateway/deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017\\\",\\n    \\\"reasoningEffort\\\": \\\"max\\\",\\n    \\\"serviceTier\\\": null,\\n    \\\"sandboxMode\\\": \\\"danger-full-access\\\",\\n    \\\"timeoutSeconds\\\": 900\\n  },\\n  \\\"fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\\\": \\\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration/specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek\\\",\\n  \\\"lineage\\\": {\\n    \\\"sessionId\\\": \\\"fanout-deepseek-1795179440509-6d2wms\\\",\\n    \\\"parentSessionId\\\": \\\"2026-11-20T12:56:45.419Z\\\",\\n    \\\"lineageMode\\\": \\\"new\\\",\\n    \\\"allowedModes\\\": [\\\"new\\\", \\\"resume\\\", \\\"restart\\\", \\\"completed-continue\\\"],\\n    \\\"deferredModes\\\": [\\\"fork\\\"],\\n    \\\"generation\\\": 4,\\n    \\\"continuedFromRun\\\": null\\n  },\\n  \\\"reducer\\\": {\\n    \\\"enabled\\\": true,\\n    \\\"version\\\": \\\"1.0\\\",\\n    \\\"registryFile\\\": \\\"research/findings-registry.json\\\",\\n