pPermissions()` in `sync-agents-pi.cjs` are the implementation, and the `tools:` list is always\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:189:differs is drift and fails the gate:\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:206:be the same text in every tree. When the gate reports drift, fix the tree that is out of step\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:213:A dispatched route passes model and effort explicitly, so the drift surface is manual invocation\n--- generators ---\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/:\ncheck-api-boundary.sh\ncheck-markdown-links.cjs\ncodex\ncommon.sh\nconfig\ncontinuity\ncore\ndeploy-mcp.sh\ndist\ndsh\nevals\nextractors\ngraph\nlib\nloaders\nnode_modules\nobservability\nops\noptimizer\npackage.json\npi\nREADME.md\nreferences\nresource-map\nretrieval\nrules\nruntime\nruntime-mirrors\nsetup\nspec\nspec-folder\nsweep\ntemplates\ntest-fixtures\ntests\ntsconfig.json\ntypes\nutils\nvalidate-command-tree-parity.sh\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":".skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:7:  - \"runtime mirror drift\"\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:50:node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/pi/sync-agents-pi.cjs\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:51:node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/codex/sync-agents.cjs\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:52:node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-agents-dsh.cjs\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:53:node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vibe/sync-agents-vibe.cjs\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:56:What fails when a mirror drifts:\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:58:- `node .skilled/bin/check-agent-mirror-sync.cjs --all`\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:61:- `node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/pi/sync-agents-pi.cjs --check`,\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:62:  `node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/codex/sync-agents.cjs --check`,\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:63:  `node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-agents-dsh.cjs --check` and\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:64:  `node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/vibe/sync-agents-vibe.cjs --check` fail when a\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:106:`mapPermissions()` in `sync-agents-pi.cjs` are the implementation, and the `tools:` list is always\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:189:differs is drift and fails the gate:\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:206:be the same text in every tree. When the gate reports drift, fix the tree that is out of step\n.skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md:213:A dispatched route passes model and effort explicitly, so the drift surface is manual invocation\n--- generators ---\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/:\ncheck-api-boundary.sh\ncheck-markdown-links.cjs\ncodex\ncommon.sh\nconfig\ncontinuity\ncore\ndeploy-mcp.sh\ndist\ndsh\nevals\nextractors\ngraph\nlib\nloaders\nnode_modules\nobservability\nops\noptimizer\npackage.json\npi\nREADME.md\nreferences\nresource-map\nretrieval\nrules\nruntime\nruntime-mirrors\nsetup\nspec\nspec-folder\nsweep\ntemplates\ntest-fixtures\ntests\ntsconfig.json\ntypes\nutils\nvalidate-command-tree-parity.sh\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration && grep -rn \\\"agent-mirror\\\\|mirror.*parity\\\\|sync-agents\\\\|drift\\\" --include=*.md .skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md | head -20; echo \\\"--- generators ---\\\"; ls .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/pi/ .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/ 2>/dev/null | head -40\"}"},"time":{"start":1795179609042,"end":1795179609328}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795179609334,"sessionID":"ses_e06f76d3effe0tIIpNFnvfaBvH","part":{"partID":"prt_1f90afaba001lCLxgFs9xxl9uy","sessionID":"ses_e06f76d3effe0tIIpNFnvfaBvH","messageID":"msg_1f90af5d4001y5IOdc30nDGPIf","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b408284ae7a0c847","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration && echo \"skilled commands: $(ls .skilled/commands | wc -l)\"; ls .skilled/commands; echo \"--- claude commands ---\"; ls .claude/commands; echo \"--- opencode commands ---\"; ls .opencode/commands"},"output":"skilled commands:       11\nassets\ncreate\ndeep\ndesign\ndoctor\nlocal-doc-alignment.md\nlocal-skilled-alignment.md\nprompt\nREADME.txt\nscripts\nspeckit\n--- claude commands ---\ncreate\ndeep\ndesign\ndoctor\nlocal-doc-alignment.md\nlocal-skilled-alignment.md\nprompt\nspeckit\n--- opencode commands ---\ncreate\ndeep\ndesign\ndoctor\ngoal-opencode.md\nlocal-doc-alignment.md\nlocal-skilled-alignment.md\nprompt\nREADME.txt\nscripts\nspeckit\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"skilled commands:       11\nassets\ncreate\ndeep\ndesign\ndoctor\nlocal-doc-alignment.md\nlocal-skilled-alignment.md\nprompt\nREADME.txt\nscripts\nspeckit\n--- claude commands ---\ncreate\ndeep\ndesign\ndoctor\nlocal-doc-alignment.md\nlocal-skilled-alignment.md\nprompt\nspeckit\n--- opencode commands ---\ncreate\ndeep\ndesign\ndoctor\ngoal-opencode.md\nlocal-doc-alignment.md\nlocal-skilled-alignment.md\nprompt\nREADME.txt\nscripts\nspeckit\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration && echo \\\"skilled commands: $(ls .skilled/commands | wc -l)\\\"; ls .skilled/commands; echo \\\"--- claude commands ---\\\"; ls .claude/commands; echo \\\"--- opencode commands ---\\\"; ls .opencode/commands\"}"},"time":{"start":1795179608762,"end":1795179609334}}}}
