{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795179712165,"sessionID":"ses_e06f76d3effe0tIIpNFnvfaBvH","part":{"partID":"prt_1f90c8a28002rWtWLb5wReKdXJ","sessionID":"ses_e06f76d3effe0tIIpNFnvfaBvH","messageID":"msg_1f90c7cc2001lUqkjYNucYxetH","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-bd54d63ce1d7c5a7","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/iterations/iteration-001.md","oldString":"- New information ratio: 0.75\n- Questions addressed: the cross-CLI difference enumeration; the single adapter contract.\n- Questions answered: both questions the node named, at the level of concrete file:line differences and a concrete contract shape.","newString":"- New information ratio: 0.79\n- Questions addressed: the cross-CLI difference enumeration; the single adapter contract.\n- Questions answered: both questions the node named, at the level of concrete file:line differences and a concrete contract shape.\n- Finding mix: 4 fully new (sandbox fidelity, prompt channel, needs_input, resume), 3 partially new (cost observability builds on the delivered cost reader; the matrix gap builds on the one-executor-path work; the mirror check confirms a claim rather than adding a mechanism)."},"output":"Edited specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/iterations/iteration-001.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/iterations/iteration-001.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/iterations/iteration-001.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/r