ssion, and any other invariant or warning this run shows firing without a real fault.\"\n    ],\n    \"keyQuestions\": [\n     \"Bookkeeping that fires on a healthy run: the synthesis_incomplete alarm on a finding refined into an earlier id, the research commit step failing on an ignored pathspec exclude, the closeout lineageId taken from the parent session, and any other invariant or warning this run shows firing without a real fault.\"\n    ]\n   }\n  ],\n  \"answeredQuestionSourceCounts\": {\n   \"frontier-F-1-004\": 4,\n   \"frontier-F-1-006\": 10\n  },\n  \"frontierOpen\": 3,\n  \"frontierTotal\": 5,\n  \"frontierAnswered\": 2,\n  \"fanoutLineage\": true\n },\n \"counters\": {\n  \"stuckCount\": 0,\n  \"consecutiveFailureCount\": 0\n }\n}\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration && DEEP_LOOP_COVERAGE_DB_DIR=\\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/graph-db\\\" node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs --spec-folder \\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode\\\" --loop-type \\\"research\\\" --session-id \\\"fanout-deepseek-1795179440509-6d2wms\\\" --convergence-mode \\\"default\\\" --depth-mode \\\"expansive\\\" --persist-snapshot --iteration 4 --stop-decision --config-path \\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-config.json\\\" --state-log \\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-state.jsonl\\\" --registry-path \\\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/findings-registry.json\\\" --iteration-count 3 2>&1 | node -e \\