{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795180038678,"sessionID":"ses_e06f76d3effe0tIIpNFnvfaBvH","part":{"partID":"prt_1f9118433002MjY501HI2JkXUZ","sessionID":"ses_e06f76d3effe0tIIpNFnvfaBvH","messageID":"msg_1f9117b4e001VYmrxZdKznY0ak","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-80880371433fae89","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":4,\"runId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795179440509-6d2wms\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795179440509-6d2wms\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795179440509-6d2wms\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":4,\"status\":\"insight\",\"focus\":\"Frontier node F-1-002 (depth 1, scope fanout-run.cjs LINEAGE_COMMAND_ADAPTERS, runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts, runtime/scripts/dispatch-iteration.cjs, .claude .codex .pi .dsh .vibe .opencode mirrors against .skilled): Cross-CLI execution contract: where do permission and sandbox, effort, output format, session resume, failure classes, log shape and prompt channel still differ across LINEAGE_COMMAND_ADAPTERS, executor-config.ts and dispatch-iteration.cjs, and what single adapter contract and conformance test (agent and command mirrors included) would remove the differences?\",\"findingsCount\":4,\"newInfoRatio\":0.60,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Four partially new synthesis findings collapse the iteration-1 differences into one seven-field contract, plus the simplicity bonus.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Cross-CLI execution contract: where do permission and sandbox, effort, output format, session resume, failure classes, log shape and prompt channel still differ across LINEAGE_COMMAND_ADAPTERS, executor-config.ts and dispatch-iteration.cjs, and what single adapter contract and conformance test (agent and command mirrors included) would remove the differences?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Cross-CLI execution contract: where do permission and sandbox, effort, output format, session resume, failure classes, log shape and prompt channel still differ across LINEAGE_COMMAND_ADAPTERS, executor-config.ts and dispatch-iteration.cjs, and what single adapter contract and conformance test (agent and command mirrors included) would remove the differences?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"deriving the contract from CLI help at test time\",\"one hand-written test per adapter kind\",\"a documentation-only capability table\"],\"focusTrack\":\"cross-cli\",\"edgeCase\":\"none\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts:112\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/dispatch-iteration.cjs:538\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/stress/cli-adapter/fixtures/adapter-suite.ts:92\",\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/iterations/iteration-001.md:19\"],\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-001\",\"label\":\"The adapter contract is one seven-field capability record per ExecutorKind, placed beside EXECUTOR_KIND_FLAG_SUPPORT, with every field answering a confirmed divergence\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts:112\",\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/research/lineages/deepseek/iterations/iteration-001.md:19\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-002\",\"label\":\"The conformance test is four fixture assertions over buildLineageCommand: prompt channel, sandbox round-trip, cost-source log shape and pending-question source\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/dispatch-iteration.cjs:538\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-salvage.cjs:76\",\"specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansiv