{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795180205701,"sessionID":"ses_e06f76d3effe0tIIpNFnvfaBvH","part":{"partID":"prt_1f9140dcd002vlwnFheIMzWq3j","sessionID":"ses_e06f76d3effe0tIIpNFnvfaBvH","messageID":"msg_1f91405af001UN47cHJeq33iSG","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-ab7708b5b530d062","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":6,\"runId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795179440509-6d2wms\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795179440509-6d2wms\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-deepseek-1795179440509-6d2wms\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":6,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Frontier node F-2-008 (depth 2, scope runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts, runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs): Does any runner path read EXECUTOR_SESSION_ENV_BY_KIND and persist a provider session id for a --only-lineage rerun, or is it detection-only?\",\"findingsCount\":4,\"newInfoRatio\":0.75,\"noveltyJustification\":\"2 of 4 findings are fully new traces (detection-only, artifact-only) and 2 refine the guard coverage and the naming/capture fix.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Does any runner path read EXECUTOR_SESSION_ENV_BY_KIND and persist a provider session id for a --only-lineage rerun, or is it detection-only?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Does any runner path read EXECUTOR_SESSION_ENV_BY_KIND and persist a provider session id for a --only-lineage rerun, or is it detection-only?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"persisting the parent env value as a rerun identity\",\"adding resume flags to all eight adapters at once\",\"treating the preview session_id as a provider id\"],\"focusTrack\":\"rerun-identity\",\"edgeCase\":\"ambiguous-input\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts:85\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/